<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>8.8.5: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02210</md:content-id>
    <md:title>8.8.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>e5003664-d253-4e66-a906-98f2fdbf6054</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><emphasis><emphasis>
    <para>Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</para>
  </emphasis></emphasis>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>Which of the following is equivalent to \(10^2−12^2\)?</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((10 + 12)(10 + 12)\) </item>
  <item> \((10 − 12)(10 − 12)\) </item>
  <item> \((10 −12)^2\) </item>
  <item> \((10 + 12)(10 − 12)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((10 + 12)(10 − 12)\)</para>
<para>For questions 2 – 10, select the expression in factored form.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(c^2 − 25\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \(c(c − 25)\) </item>
  <item> \((c − 5)(c − 5)\) </item>
  <item> \((c − 5)(c + 5)\) </item>
  <item> \((c + 5)(c + 5)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((c − 5)(c + 5)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(9w^2 − 121\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((3w − 11)(3w + 11)\) </item>
  <item> \((3w + 11)(3w + 11)\) </item>
  <item> \(w(9w − 121)\) </item>
  <item> \((3w − 11)(3w − 11)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((3w − 11)(3w + 11)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(h^2− 121\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((h − 11)^2\) </item>
  <item> \((h − 11)(h + 11)\) </item>
  <item> \((h − 11)(h − 11)\) </item>
  <item> \((h + 11)(h + 11)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((h − 11)(h + 11)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(64 − d^2\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((8 − d)(8 − d)\) </item>
  <item> \((8 − d)(8 + d)\) </item>
  <item> \((8 + d)(8 + d)\) </item>
  <item> Not possible </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((8 − d)(8 + d)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(4b^2 − 25\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((2b − 5)(2b + 5)\) </item>
  <item> \((2b − 5)(2b − 5)\) </item>
  <item> \(b(4b − 25)\) </item>
  <item> \((2b + 5)(2b + 5)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((2b − 5)(2b + 5)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="7" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(49 − 81z^2\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((7 + 9z)(7 + 9z)\) </item>
  <item> \((7 − 9z)(7 − 9z)\) </item>
  <item> \(z(49 − 81z)\) </item>
  <item> \((7 − 9z)(7 + 9z)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((7 − 9z)(7 + 9z)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(100y^2−4\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((10y + 2)(10y + 2)\) </item>
  <item> \((10y − 2)(10y + 2)\) </item>
  <item> \((10y − 2)(10y − 2)\) </item>
  <item> Not possible </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((10y − 2)(10y + 2)\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="9" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(x^2+9\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((x − 3)(x − 3)\) </item>
  <item> \((x − 3)(x + 3)\) </item>
  <item> \((x + 3)(x + 3)\) </item>
  <item> Not possible </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> Not possible</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="10" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(144 − 16g^2\)</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> \((12 − 4g)(12 + 4g)\) </item>
  <item> \((12 + 4g)(12 + 4g)\) </item>
  <item> \((12 − 4g)(12 − 4g)\) </item>
  <item> Not possible </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \((12 − 4g)(12 + 4g)\)</para></section>
</content>
